{"applicability_conditions":"适用于 fcc 金属中扩展位错（Shockley 不全位错）的平衡间距计算；在 Mahajan and Chin 形核模型背景下使用。","identity":{"block_id":"b0079","equation_id":"equation_021","equation_number":"21","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\nx _ {0} = \\frac {G b _ {\\mathrm{s}}}{\\gamma_ {\\mathrm{sf}}} \\frac {b _ {\\mathrm{s}}}{8 \\pi} \\frac {2 + v}{1 - v}, b _ {\\mathrm{s}} = \\frac {b}{\\sqrt {3}}\\tag{21}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1007_s11837-014-1032-x"},"latex":"x_{0} = \\frac{G b_{\\mathrm{s}}}{\\gamma_{\\mathrm{sf}}} \\frac{b_{\\mathrm{s}}}{8\\pi} \\frac{2 + v}{1 - v}, b_{\\mathrm{s}} = \\frac{b}{\\sqrt{3}}","purpose":"计算 fcc 金属中 Shockley 不全位错（扩展位错）的平衡间距 x_0。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"Shockley 不全位错（扩展位错）的平衡间距","symbol":"x_{0}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"剪切模量 (shear modulus)","symbol":"G","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"Shockley 不全位错 Burgers 矢量的大小，b_s = b/√3","symbol":"b_{\\mathrm{s}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"层错能 (stacking fault energy)","symbol":"\\gamma_{\\mathrm{sf}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"完整位错 Burgers 矢量的大小","symbol":"b","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"泊松比 (Poisson's ratio)","symbol":"v","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"圆周率","symbol":"\\pi","unit":null,"value":null}],"unmapped":["x_c = 10 Å 为极端情况下两个束缚不全位错须接近的临界距离（Mahajan and Chin 形核模型设定）。"]}